# Copy to .env and fill in, or export the variable in your shell instead.
# .env is gitignored; never commit the real key.
#
# Only needed for input rows that have no "panoId" and must be resolved from
# their coordinates. Tile fetching -- the whole image pipeline -- needs no key.
#
# Google documents Street View *metadata* requests as free of charge, but they
# still require a billing-enabled project. Check current pricing before use:
# https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/streetview/usage-and-billing
GSV_API_KEY=your-google-maps-api-key-here
